.TH MODBUS-FAKE-CTL 1 "2026-11-05" "pv-suite 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
modbus-fake-ctl \- one-shot control client for the fake inverter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B modbus-fake-ctl
.RI [ options ]
.IB command " [args ...]"
.br
.B modbus-fake-ctl
.RI [ options ]
< commands

.SH DESCRIPTION
Sends one control command (or a batch piped on stdin, one per line) to the
\fBmodbus-fake-inverter\fR JSON-lines control server and prints the
replies on stdout, one per line. Every invocation lands in the audit trail
(prefix \fBCTL\fR).
.PP
The command grammar is the fake's: \fBset\fR/\fBunset\fR/\fBshow\fR/
\fBhelp\fR (the 26-setting registry), \fBshow status\fR,
\fBshow connections\fR (the live Modbus clients: peer, age, requests),
\fBshow settings\fR, \fBshow registers\fR, \fBshow version\fR,
\fBshow knobs\fR (the dictionary of the registry),
\fBinspect\fR, \fBreset\fR, \fBshutdown\fR, \fBquit\fR. See
.BR modbus-fake-inverter (1)
CONTROL.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-control\-port
control server target: unix socket path or TCP port on 127.0.0.1,
auto\-detected (default: /tmp/fake\-inverter\-5502.socket; env CTL when
unset) — same flag as the fake itself
.TP
.B command
control command, e.g. set pv 2500, set scenario noon, show settings,
status, reset, shutdown
.TP
.BI \-\-timeout " N"
socket timeout in seconds (default 5.0)
.TP
.B \-\-control\-token
control auth token for TCP (env CONTROL_TOKEN)
.TP
.B \-\-control\-token\-file
the token from a file (the first line; must be owner\-only 0600); not
for use with \-\-control\-token (env CONTROL_TOKEN_FILE)
.TP
.B \-\-audit\-log
audit trail: a file path or \- for stdout; default: the XDG state home
.TP
.BI \-\-audit\-max\-mb " N"
rotate the audit log at this size, 0 = off (default: 10.0)
.TP
.BI \-\-audit\-files " N"
rotated audit backups to keep (default 3)
.TP
.B \-\-no\-audit\-log
disable the audit trail (default: off)


.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.IP \(bu 2
.B modbus-fake-ctl set pv 2500
.IP \(bu 2
.B modbus-fake-ctl show settings
.IP \(bu 2
.B printf 'set pv 2500\\nset soc 30\\nshow status\\n' | modbus-fake-ctl
.RE

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
every command answered \fBok\fR.
.TP
.B 1
connection or control error.
.TP
.B 2
command-line misuse.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR modbus-fake-inverter (1),
.BR modbus-fake-cli (1)
